      "side": 1,
      "message": "FYI, It looks like [`memset_explicit`](https://open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n2897.htm) might finally be [coming to C23](https://thephd.dev/c23-is-coming-here-is-what-is-on-the-menu).\n\nIn `libbrillo`, I added [`secure_clear`](https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2021/p1315r7.html), which was the previously proposed name for `memset_explicit`.",
      "parentUuid": "04835bd5_da49f359",
