      "writtenOn": "2022-09-24T01:37:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e FYI, It looks like memset_explicit might finally be coming to C23.\n\u003e \n\u003e In libbrillo, I added secure_clear, which was the previously proposed name for memset_explicit.\n\nOh, nice! I also saw that there is some `memset_s` now, which libsodium has the option to use. I\u0027m not totally sure I understand the difference.",
      "parentUuid": "390eaf57_bc2f39d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 0,
